#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:8
msgid "为 I/O 提供执行与存储"
msgstr "Provide I/O execution and storage"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:10
msgid ""
"取得 factory 接口以后，日常调用直接进入其操作表。Platform 管所选基础设施的 启动与停止；应用负责任务、调度、队列、service "
"频率、缓冲与恢复决策。"
msgstr ""
"After acquiring a factory interface, ordinary calls go directly through its "
"operation table. Platform starts and stops selected infrastructure. The "
"application owns tasks, scheduling, queues, service frequency, buffers and "
"recovery decisions."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:13
msgid "一个接口，一个明确执行者"
msgstr "One explicit executor for each interface"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:15
msgid ""
"轮询模式在所选预算内完成操作；IRQ／DMA 模式需要按接口合同提供通知、service 或 等待适配。多个 producer 共享 UART／SPI "
"时，选择显式 owner，避免不同任务同时 推进同一控制器状态。平台不会隐式创建 worker，也不会启动 scheduler。"
msgstr ""
"Polling modes complete operations within the selected budget. IRQ/DMA modes "
"require notification, service or wait adaptation according to the interface "
"contract. When multiple producers share a UART/SPI controller, select an "
"explicit owner so different tasks do not advance the same controller state "
"concurrently. The platform creates no implicit worker and does not start the"
" scheduler."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:19
msgid "普通接口不为未选异步模式分配最大状态或缓冲。先从实际任务选择有限请求或连续流， 再确定容量和执行方式，具体模式以支持矩阵和完整配置校验为准。"
msgstr ""
"An ordinary interface does not allocate maximum state or buffers for "
"unselected asynchronous modes. Choose a finite request or continuous stream "
"from the actual task, then determine capacity and execution. Available modes"
" are bounded by the support matrix and complete configuration validation."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:22
msgid "有限请求的最小闭环"
msgstr "The minimal finite-request cycle"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:24
msgid "应用准备请求、payload 和同一单调时间域的绝对 deadline。"
msgstr ""
"The application prepares a request, payload and absolute deadline in the "
"same monotonic time domain."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:25
msgid "`REJECTED` 不保留调用者引用；处理错误后可按合同重试。"
msgstr ""
"`REJECTED` retains no caller references; handle the error before retrying as"
" permitted by the contract."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:26
msgid "`ACCEPTED` 开始借用，持续推进其执行者，观察请求状态。"
msgstr ""
"`ACCEPTED` begins a borrow. Continue advancing its executor and observing "
"request state."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:27
msgid "acquire 观察 `SETTLED` 后读取最终结果，确认控制与观察者也已排空。"
msgstr ""
"After an acquire observation of `SETTLED`, read the final result and confirm"
" that control activity and observers have also drained."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:28
msgid "再归还或复用相应存储。"
msgstr "Only then return or reuse the relevant storage."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:30
msgid ""
"通知是提示，请求谓词是完成依据。DMA 搬运完成、线上完成和引用排空是不同事件。 取消、超时和 `QUARANTINED` "
"都不授权提前释放；失败后保持存储，继续既定排空或 "
"进入产品恢复流程。[所有权合同](../explanation/ownership.md)定义完整状态规则。"
msgstr ""
"Notification is a hint; the request predicate determines completion. DMA "
"transfer completion, wire completion and reference drain are separate "
"events. Cancellation, timeout and `QUARANTINED` do not authorize early "
"release. Retain storage after failure and continue the defined drain path or"
" enter product recovery. The [ownership "
"contract](../explanation/ownership.md) defines the full state rules."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:34
msgid "连续流与停止"
msgstr "Continuous streams and stop"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:36
msgid ""
"按流合同取得并归还 loan，借用期间不改数据。容量耗尽时处理 loss／backpressure； `BUSY` stop "
"仍可能保留已发布的借用。归还、排空并 join 相关 owner、producer 和 观察者之后，才重新使用其状态。"
msgstr ""
"Acquire and return loans according to the stream contract; do not modify "
"borrowed data. Handle loss/backpressure when capacity is exhausted. A `BUSY`"
" stop may retain published borrows. Return loans, drain and join relevant "
"owners, producers and observers before reusing their state."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:40
msgid ""
"停止应用时先关闭新请求，再请求取消并继续 service，等待真正排空。最后按后端 允许的顺序停止 Platform。FreeRTOS "
"scheduler 已尝试启动后不能按“任务从未运行” 逆序丢弃状态；内核仍使用的 Tick／时钟必须保留，见 [OS 停止](os-"
"shutdown.md)。"
msgstr ""
"When stopping an application, first close admission to new requests, then "
"request cancellation and continue service until actual drain. Finally stop "
"Platform in the order permitted by the backend. After a FreeRTOS scheduler "
"start has been attempted, state cannot be discarded in reverse order as "
"though tasks never ran. Preserve Tick/clock infrastructure still used by the"
" kernel; see [OS shutdown](os-shutdown.md)."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:45
msgid "五条最小使用路径"
msgstr "Five minimal usage paths"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:47
msgid ""
"配套 [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-examples) 维护实际应用 "
"C， 平台不复制另一份应用实现。阅读时核对例库 gitlink 与 SDK lock；主工程的 UART IRQ 或 SPI polling "
"装配不能代替独立 DMA 装配。以下每条都需明确配置、接口、存储、 执行者、正常顺序、失败退出和实际验证范围。"
msgstr ""
"The companion [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-"
"examples) maintains the actual application C code; the platform does not "
"duplicate the application implementation. Check the examples gitlink and "
"SDK lock when reading. The main project's UART IRQ or SPI polling "
"assembly cannot substitute for a separate DMA assembly. Each path below "
"must specify its configuration, interface, storage, executor, normal "
"sequence, failure exit and actual validation scope."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:52
msgid "同步 GPIO"
msgstr "Synchronous GPIO"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:54
msgid ""
"`apps/platform_reference/` 与起始模板使用所选 Board 的已审极性。取得 strong logical signal"
" 后调用 `nx_gpio_signal_write` 或 `nx_gpio_signal_read`；业务不重复 pin mask 和极性。 "
"未知极性不从初始电平猜测，逻辑 inactive 也不表示高阻或电气断能。"
msgstr ""
"`apps/platform_reference/` and the starter template use the reviewed "
"polarity of the selected Board. After obtaining a strong logical signal, "
"call `nx_gpio_signal_write` or `nx_gpio_signal_read`; application logic "
"does not repeat pin masks or polarity. Do not infer unknown polarity from"
" the initial level. Logical inactive does not imply high impedance or "
"electrical de-energization."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:59
msgid ""
"这条路径只需同步调用和明确写入者，不承担 request、队列或 worker。停止写入者后 再停 Platform；启动或停止失败保留其 "
"primary、cleanup 和 remaining effects。"
msgstr ""
"This path needs only synchronous calls and an explicit writer; it has no "
"request, queue or worker responsibilities. Stop the writer before "
"stopping Platform. If startup or shutdown fails, retain its primary, "
"cleanup and remaining effects."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:62
msgid "有限 UART DMA"
msgstr "Finite UART DMA"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:64
msgid ""
"选择真实 `dma-tx` 装配，调用者持有 request、payload 和同一时钟域的有限绝对 deadline。先用 "
"`nx_deadline_finite_after` 检查有限预算，失败时拒绝本次准入。 请求接受后由同一执行者持续推进；DMA TC、UART "
"TC 和 acquire 观察 SETTLED 分别证明内存搬运、线上完成及借用结束。该模式原有 RX 职责仍由同一 owner 持有。"
msgstr ""
"Select an actual `dma-tx` assembly. The caller holds the request, payload"
" and a finite absolute deadline in the same clock domain. First check the"
" finite budget with `nx_deadline_finite_after`; reject admission if this "
"fails. After the request is accepted, the same executor must keep "
"advancing it. DMA TC, UART TC and acquire-observed SETTLED respectively "
"establish memory transfer, wire completion and the end of the borrow. The"
" same owner retains the mode's existing RX responsibilities."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:69
msgid ""
"取消或超时仅请求终止。每次推进返回进行中或保留责任时，原 request、payload、 回调和硬件资源继续存活；QUARANTINED "
"不允许直接退出存储作用域。仅使用该模式 实际提供的恢复操作，无恢复能力时由外部产品决定停机或复位。"
msgstr ""
"Cancellation or timeout only requests termination. Whenever an "
"advancement step reports work in progress or retained responsibilities, "
"the original request, payload, callbacks and hardware resources must "
"remain alive. QUARANTINED does not permit leaving the storage scope. Use "
"only recovery operations actually provided by the mode. If no recovery "
"capability exists, the external product decides whether to shut down or "
"reset."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:73
msgid "有限 SPI DMA"
msgstr "Finite SPI DMA"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:75
msgid ""
"从 controller 取得已配置 endpoint，起始路径只用一个执行者。调用者持有 request、 段表与 TX/RX "
"span，并明确帧宽、数量单位、CS 时序及允许的重叠关系。需要多个 producer 时才接入既有 SPI owner，不为单次 DMA "
"强制增加队列和线程。"
msgstr ""
"Obtain the configured endpoint from the controller and use one executor "
"for the initial path. The caller holds the request, segment table and "
"TX/RX spans, and specifies the frame width, count units, CS timing and "
"permitted overlaps. Connect the existing SPI owner only when multiple "
"producers are needed; a single DMA operation does not mandate an "
"additional queue and thread."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:79
msgid ""
"双向 DMA 的 memory TC 不代替 wire idle 或 CS 合同完成。取消、错误和排空期间仍 保留全部被接受的 "
"span；acquire 观察 SETTLED 后读取最终结果和实际传输前缀， 失败结果也不表示零效果。"
msgstr ""
"Memory TC for bidirectional DMA does not establish wire idle or "
"completion of the CS contract. Retain all accepted spans during "
"cancellation, errors and draining. After an acquire observation of "
"SETTLED, read the final result and actual transfer prefix; a failure "
"result does not imply zero effects."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:83
msgid "连续 ADC blocks"
msgstr "Continuous ADC blocks"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:85
msgid ""
"`apps/stream_recovery/` 维护采集和退出组合；`recipes/control/` 另演示数据处理。 配置明确 scan "
"格式、硬件触发、rate、service 上界和 DMA 可达存储。容量包含硬件 目标、替换块和消费者保留；CCM 等 CPU-only "
"内存不能作为 DMA 目标。"
msgstr ""
"`apps/stream_recovery/` maintains acquisition and exit combinations; "
"`recipes/control/` separately demonstrates data processing. The "
"configuration specifies the scan format, hardware trigger, rate, service "
"upper bound and DMA-reachable storage. Capacity includes hardware "
"targets, replacement blocks and blocks retained by consumers. CPU-only "
"memory such as CCM cannot be a DMA target."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:89
msgid ""
"按 service、acquire 完整 block、处理、release 原 token 推进。EMPTY 不复用旧样本， LOSS "
"和错误由应用明确决定是否停止。调用所选停止操作，由 provider 先撤新触发； 调用者继续排空 filling、READY 和 "
"BORROWED。release 或 stop 失败保留原 token、 状态和 executor，不清零重启。"
msgstr ""
"Advance through service, acquire of a complete block, processing and "
"release of the original token. EMPTY does not permit reuse of old "
"samples. The application explicitly decides whether LOSS or errors "
"require stopping. Call the selected stop operation; the provider first "
"withdraws new triggers, and the caller continues draining filling, READY "
"and BORROWED. If release or stop fails, retain the original token, state "
"and executor; do not zero them and restart."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:94
msgid "连续音频 blocks"
msgstr "Continuous audio blocks"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:96
msgid ""
"按精确 I2S/SAI 装配选择 layout、主从时钟、rate 与调用者 block 存储；frame、 sample 和 DMA "
"container 的单位分别读取公共合同。实际提交或取得完整 block 后， 按对应方向归还借用；TX 与 RX "
"不共用一份已回收证明，duplex 停止须两侧真实退出。"
msgstr ""
"Select the layout, master/slave clocks, rate and caller-owned block "
"storage for the exact I2S/SAI assembly. Read the public contracts "
"separately for the units of frame, sample and DMA container. After "
"actually submitting or acquiring a complete block, return the borrow for "
"the corresponding direction. TX and RX each require their own reclamation"
" evidence; stopping duplex requires both sides to actually exit."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:100
msgid ""
"underrun、overrun、缺少替换块或外部时钟停止走显式错误与退出路径。平台不自动 "
"填静音或丢弃借用数据。有限运行窗口结束只停止新增工作；每次 step 的工作量上限 不构成物理停机时限，失败排空仍保留原 owner 与数据。"
msgstr ""
"An underrun, overrun, missing replacement block or stopped external clock"
" follows an explicit error and exit path. The platform does not "
"automatically fill silence or discard borrowed data. Ending a finite run "
"window only stops adding new work. The work limit of each step does not "
"establish a physical shutdown time limit. A failed drain still retains "
"the original owner and data."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:104
msgid ""
"上述用例的软件行为、真实 provider 的 ARM 链接和物理时序分别验收。Native mock "
"只替代外部端口，不代替应用退出逻辑，也不建立真实 DMA、电气或采样时序资格。"
msgstr ""
"The software behavior of these use cases, ARM linking of the real "
"provider and physical timing are accepted separately. Native mocks "
"replace only external ports. They do not replace application exit logic "
"or establish qualification for real DMA, electrical behavior or sampling "
"timing."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:107
msgid "查看诊断"
msgstr "Inspect diagnostics"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:109
msgid ""
"`nx_io_diagnose` 复制当前请求和流事实，不执行恢复，不归还借用。`unknown_facts` "
"保留未知信息；`SERVICE_OVERDUE` 需要同时间域内实际时间戳和明确 service 预算。 "
"`nx_dma_storage_validate` 校验完整显式存储预留，不只校验首地址对齐。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_io_diagnose` copies current request and stream facts; it does not "
"recover or return borrows. `unknown_facts` preserves unknown information. "
"`SERVICE_OVERDUE` requires actual timestamps in the same time domain and an "
"explicit service budget. `nx_dma_storage_validate` validates the complete "
"explicit storage reservation, not only alignment of its first address."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/io-execution.md:113
msgid ""
"用[异步请求教程](../tutorials/async-io.md)练习成功与失败路径，公共签名见 [I/O "
"API](../reference/api/io/index.md)，实际延迟与吞吐测量见 [性能与 HIL](performance-hil.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Practice success and failure paths with the [asynchronous-request "
"tutorial](../tutorials/async-io.md). Public signatures are in the [I/O "
"API](../reference/api/io/index.md); real latency and throughput measurements"
" are covered by [performance and HIL](performance-hil.md)."

msgid ""
"下面的固定例库基线提供完整源码、TOML 和构建命令。实际工程继续按自己的 gitlink／SDK lock "
"消费，不能把固定链接的执行结果继承给另一版本。"
msgstr ""
"The fixed example baseline below provides complete source, TOML and "
"build commands. Actual projects continue to consume their own "
"gitlink/SDK lock; execution results from a fixed link do not transfer to"
" another revision."

